msgstr[1] "{n} celule de grilă din vizualizare nu au putut fi calculate"
msgstr[2] "{n} de celule de grilă din vizualizare nu au putut fi calculate"

#. Translators: {} is how long each window (square image
#. the model predicts from) takes, in seconds.
#: src/present.rs:1333
msgid "Computing · {} s per window"
msgstr "Se calculează · {} s per fereastră"

#. Translators: {} is the name of the model that is loaded.
#: src/present.rs:1344
msgid "Ready: {}"
msgstr "Gata: {}"

#: src/present.rs:1367
msgid "No slide"
msgstr "Nicio lamă"

#. Translators: the slide's pixel size in micrometres per pixel
